<p>Spin your saws wildly around you to create a wall of steamy sawteeth.</p><p>All melee damage against you is reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 14%, 18%, 20%, 22%,</acronym> you have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 14%, 18%, 20%, 22%</acronym> chance to evade projectiles and you can never take a blow that deals more than <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">104%, 91%, 84%, 78%, 74%</acronym> of your max life.</p><p><span style="font-style: italic"><span class="tstr-font-italic">Split their bones on the saws of death!</span></span></p>